  {
   "id": "elementallis-140804@patch-2026-04-30",
   "gameId": "elementallis-140804",
   "displayName": "First Patch Now Released!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-30T09:23:30.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We released our first patch today, which includes the following fixes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When swapping A and B controls, markers couldn't be placed properly on the map",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In Catalan language there were a couple sentences that put /ART instead of the proper article",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The minecarts in the Volcano mines and the Ice Temple could have the wrong path under certain circumstances.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You could use the wind in the wind temple to avoid a group of elevable blocks. When done, a restart was needed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When the player got frozen after being killed, the game could pause, needing to restart.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A camera change in the beach could trigger incorrectly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The room where you get the Ice element now closes when you enter, forcing the player to jump down.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
